{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09014","headline":"过扶风精舍旧居简朝宗巨川兄弟 · 韦应物","name":"过扶风精舍旧居简朝宗巨川兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛刹出高树，晨光闾井中。\n年深念陈迹，迨此独忡忡。\n零落逢故老，寂寥悲草虫。\n旧宇多改构，幽篁延本丛。\n栖止事如昨，芳时去已空。\n佳人亦携手，再往今不同。\n新文聊感旧，想子意无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}